🏗️ Current Seasonality Software System Architecture
Data Flow & Storage Architecture
1. Data Sources & Ingestion
Raw Data Sources:
├── Seasonality.csv (Primary OHLCV data for all symbols)
├── SpecialDays/SpecialDays.csv (Holiday/special day definitions)
├── elections/ElectionDates.csv (Election year data)
├── basket/basket.csv (Basket compositions)
└── Watchlist/Watchlist.csv (User watchlists)
2. Data Processing Pipeline
Seasonality.csv → GenerateMultipleFiles.py → Symbol-specific CSVs

Processing Steps:
1. Read raw Seasonality.csv
2. Group by ticker symbol
3. For each symbol:
   ├── Convert daily → weekly (Monday & Expiry weeks)
   ├── Convert daily → monthly
   ├── Convert daily → yearly
   ├── Calculate 50+ derived fields per timeframe
   └── Save 5 CSV files per symbol
3. Storage Structure
Symbols/
├── BANKNIFTY/
│   ├── 1_Daily.csv (Daily OHLCV + 50 derived fields)
│   ├── 2_MondayWeekly.csv (Monday-to-Monday weeks)
│   ├── 3_ExpiryWeekly.csv (Thursday-to-Thursday expiry weeks)
│   ├── 4_Monthly.csv (Monthly aggregations)
│   └── 5_Yearly.csv (Yearly aggregations)
├── RELIANCE/
│   └── [Same structure for each symbol]
└── [50+ other symbols...]
